;. /verify_action_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition verify_action
  ;= Verify explicit postconditions from captured records
    Each named check has target (path), optional after (exclusive x version), and expect/<slot> values. Bind observations with the same names to own-record captures: computed /x output for watching cells, raw records for frozen inspections. Equality is native pail equality. Missing, wrong-target, stale or mismatching observations refuse verification. The result retains exact captures and receipts; it makes an as-of claim only.

    ;@ /flow/input receipts
    ;= receipts

    ;@ /flow/input checks
    ;= checks

    ;@ /flow/input observations
    ;= observations

    ;@ /flow/step verified ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/verify_records
    ;@ /flow/bind receipts receipts
    ;@ /flow/bind checks checks
    ;@ /flow/bind observations observations
    ;= verified

    ;@ /flow/result verified
    ;= Verify explicit postconditions from captured records result
